// missing is a BUILD failure rather than an English word inside a French
// sentence.
//
// Keys are flat and dotted: "<surface>.<what it says>". Never nested — see
// lib/i18n/types.ts for why a nesting resolver is a bug waiting for a key
// with a dot in it.

